# ── MCP per-dev override (live .mcp.json IS committed for dev) ──
# .mcp.json is committed — dev project ref is safe because the ref
# points only at the dev Cloud project. If a per-dev override is
# needed, create .mcp.local.json (gitignored).
.mcp.local.json
